22875977", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "204856226", "author": {"steamid": "76561199248071279", "personaname": "『MG』๛DARK", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199248071279/", "num_games_owned": 253, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2905, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1042, "last_played": 1763117489, "avatar": "d84c21a60756feb8a22d2e505af06cf810e147ad"}, "language": "english", "review": "NOT TOO CREATIVE THAN SNIPER ELLITE 5", "timestamp_created": 1758449197, "timestamp_updated": 1758449197, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.486815422773361206", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204673230", "author": {"steamid": "76561199854562838", "personaname": "woody6909", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854562838/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2553, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1245, "last_played": 1779590237, "avatar": "c12cc6cb28d3873060533a347fd7a319e5f0ed7f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I just finished Sniper Elite: Resistance and it’s another fantastic entry in the series. The game feels very similar to Sniper Elite 5, which I thoroughly enjoyed, and the graphics are right there too, only minor differences, if any. The landscapes, maps, and environments are superb, exactly what I’ve come to expect from Rebellion and the Sniper Elite franchise.\r\n\r\nWhat really stood out this time is the introduction of Hawkins as the main character. He’s a refreshing change from Karl Fairburne, bringing sarcasm and that cheeky British humor into the mix. It adds personality and lightness to the otherwise tense, tactical gameplay.\r\n\r\nOverall, Resistance hit all the marks for me. I’ve become comfortable with the fact that I will immensely enjoy any Sniper Elite game at this point. Rebellion keeps delivering, and I’ll continue to be a devout fan of the series.\r\n\r\n👍 Highly recommended for anyone who loves tactical shooters or is already a fan of the series.", "timestamp_created": 1758259424, "timestamp_updated": 1758259424, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.533815979957580566", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204648964", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003115783", "personaname": "General Disorder", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/generaldisordercanada/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 3120, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 559, "last_played": 1761594615, "avatar": "2cf273aa0fedfd66b81390eccab65bf513d0fe0a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best in the series.", "timestamp_created": 1758229652, "timestamp_updated": 1758229652, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}